        "text": "Electrical oscillations in an oscillating circuit are similar to the free oscillations of a spring oscillator, an object attached to a spring.\nDifferent physical quantities change periodically, which means their changes repeat: in mechanical oscillations, the changing quantities are the object's position coordinate $x$ and its velocity component $v_x$, which gives its speed and direction along the chosen axis;"
