      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "blockIndex": 0,
        "paragraphInBlock": 2,
        "text": "This is because the conditions that produce the two kinds of oscillation are similar.\nThe elastic force $F_x$, exerted by the spring, brings the spring oscillator back toward its equilibrium position, where the spring exerts no net restoring force."
